  "prefLabel": "Fors 302.01 Candidate Requirements",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-02-05",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 302.01 Candidate Requirements. Candidates for licensure shall meet the requirements established by RSA 310-A:104 before a license shall be granted. Documentation of the applicant’s education and work experience shall be required to help determine if qualified.\n\nSource. #5222, eff 9-11-91; EXPIRED 9-11-97\n\nNew. #6597, INTERIM, eff 10-8-97, EXPIRED: 2-5-98\n\nNew. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14085, eff 11-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fors100-500.html"
